<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Signature réussie - {{ invoice.number }}</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .success-animation {
            animation: scaleIn 0.5s ease-out;
        }
        @keyframes scaleIn {
            0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-100 min-h-screen">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <!-- Header de succès -->
            <div class="text-center mb-8 success-animation">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 bg-green-600 rounded-full mb-6">
                    <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Signature réussie !</h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Votre signature a été enregistrée avec succès</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Carte de confirmation -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden success-animation">
                <!-- En-tête -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-600 to-green-700 text-white p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Facture {{ invoice.number }} signée</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-green-100">La signature électronique a été appliquée et enregistrée de manière sécurisée.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Détails de la signature -->
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Informations de signature</h3>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Signataire</p>
                                <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">{{ signerName }}</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Date et heure</p>
                                <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">{{ invoice.signedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i:s') }}</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Statut</p>
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-green-100 text-green-800">
                                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                                        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                                    </svg>
                                    Signée
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Détails de la facture</h3>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Numéro</p>
                                <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">{{ invoice.number }}</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Montant</p>
                                <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 text-xl">{{ invoice.amount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Émetteur</p>
                                <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">{{ invoice.company.name }}</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Notification envoyée -->
                    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 p-4 rounded-lg mb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 4.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                            </svg>
                            <div>
                                <p class="font-medium text-blue-900">Notification envoyée</p>
                                <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">{{ invoice.company.name }} a été automatiquement notifié de votre signature.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Informations légales -->
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-4 rounded-lg">
                        <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">Valeur légale</h4>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                            Cette signature électronique a la même valeur légale qu'une signature manuscrite conformément au 
                            <strong>règlement eIDAS</strong> et au <strong>Code civil français</strong>. 
                            Un certificat de signature horodaté a été généré et conservé de manière sécurisée.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Actions -->
            <div class="mt-8 text-center">
                <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
                    Vous pouvez maintenant fermer cette page. Un email de confirmation vous sera envoyé sous peu.
                </p>
                <button onclick="window.close()" 
                        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg text-gray-700 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
                    </svg>
                    Fermer cette page
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer de sécurité -->
            <div class="mt-8 text-center">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-green-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.166 4.999A11.954 11.954 0 0010 1.944 11.954 11.954 0 0017.834 5c.11.65.166 1.32.166 2.001 0 5.225-3.34 9.67-8 11.317C5.34 16.67 2 12.225 2 7c0-.682.057-1.35.166-2.001zm11.541 3.708a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    Signature sécurisée par FactuPro - Conforme RGPD et eIDAS
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
